# Constants - per-entity base translations (auto-extracted from __init__.msc)
# Each pieceXXBase array holds (m03, m13, m23) triples - one triple per
# entity in the piece, in the order rychessXX00, rychessXX01, .... When a
# piece moves to a new square, applyTransform reads each triple, adds the
# piece's spawn-to-target delta, and writes the result back into the
# entity's transformation[3], [7], [11] indices via /data modify (which
# preserves the rest of the matrix - rotation/scale - unlike the compound
# {translation:[...]} form which decomposes and clobbers everything else).

    

